      "message": "Keep recorder children off inherited NO_COLOR and give ffmpeg VAS.\n\nAgent shells export NO_COLOR=1, which made a painted TUI emit no 38;2 SGR.\nffmpeg also needed more than 2 GiB VAS to hash a real 1080p tape.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
